!! Proposed Definition of ''ta'i''

;__ta'i__ (BAI):  By method...  Tags a sumti as fitting the first place of tadji.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra place with the meaning of the first place of tadji and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is enacted using the methodology described or indicated by the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: tadji, se ta'i, te ta'i, ta'i ma.
** Keywords: By method, with method.

!! Examples of ''ta'i'' Usage

!! Proposed Definition of ''se ta'i''

;__se ta'i__ (BAI*):  As a method for...  Tags a sumti as fitting the second place of tadji.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra place with the meaning of the second place of tadji and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is associated with doing or performing the actions described or indicated by the referent of the tagged sumti using some method or technique unspecified (it can be specified with ta'i, however).  See also: tadji, ta'i, te ta'i, ta'i ma.
** Keywords: As a method for.

!! Examples of ''se ta'i'' Usage

!! Proposed Definition of ''te ta'i''

;__te ta'i__ (BAI*):  Method conditions...  Tags a sumti as fitting the third place of tadji.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra place with the meaning of the third place of tadji and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is associated with necessary conditions for performance (of some method or technique unspecified) described or indicated by the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: tadji, ta'i, se ta'i, ta'i ma.
** Keywords:  Method conditions.

!! Examples of ''te ta'i'' Usage

mi sevzi lumci te ta'i lo nu mi to'e jinsa
''I wash myself, this being sensible in the case that I am dirty.''

!! Proposed Definition of '' ta'i ma   ''

;__ta'i ma__ (BAI*):  By what method?   Tags a sumti question marker as fitting the first place of tadji.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra place with the meaning of the first place of tadji and then fills it with a sumti question cmavo (ma).  In other words, the tagged sumti asks what methodology is used to enact the event described by the bridi.  See also: tadji, ta'i, se ta'i, te ta'i.
** Keywords: By what method?, how?

!! Examples of '' ta'i ma   '' Usage

