;__se ga'a__ (BAI*):  Observing...  Tags a sumti as fitting the second place of zgana.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra place with the meaning of the second place of zgana and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is associated with the observation of the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: zgana, ga'a, te ga'a, ve ga'a.
** Keywords: Observing, taking note of.

!! Examples of ''se ga'a'' Usage

!! Proposed Definition of ''te ga'a''

;__te ga'a__ (BAI*):  Observed by means...  Tags a sumti as fitting the third place of zgana.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra place with the meaning of the third place of zgana and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is associated with an observation performed in a fashion indicated or described by the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: zgana, ga'a, se ga'a, ve ga'a.
** Keywords: Observed by means.

!! Examples of ''te ga'a'' Usage

mi jimpe lo selci te ga'a lo dikca ratni cmatcatci
''I understand cells, having observed them with an electron microscope.''

!! Proposed Definition of ''ve ga'a''

;__ve ga'a__ (BAI*):  Observed under conditions... Tags a sumti as fitting the fourth place of zgana.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra place with the meaning of the fourth place of zgana and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is associated with an observation made under the conditions indicated or described by the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: zgana, ga'a, se ga'a, te ga'a.
** Keywords: Observed under conditions...

!! Examples of ''ve ga'a'' Usage

!! Proposed Definition of ''ji'o''

;__ji'o__ (BAI):  Under the diection of...  Tags a sumti as fitting the first place of jitro.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra place with the meaning of the first place of jitro and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is undertaken under the direction or control of the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: jitro, se ji'o, te ji'o.
** Keywords: Under the direction of.

!! Examples of ''ji'o'' Usage

!! Proposed Definition of ''se ji'o''

;__se ji'o__ (BAI*):  Controlling aspects...  Tags a sumti as fitting the second place of jitro.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra place with the meaning of the second place of jitro and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is associated with some form of control over an action or event, and that the aspects of that control are described or indicated by the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: jitro, ji'o, te ji'o.
** Keywords:  Controlling apsects, guiding aspects.

!! Examples of ''se ji'o'' Usage

!! Proposed Definition of ''te ji'o''

;__te ji'o__ (BAI*):  Controlling event...  Tags a sumti as fitting the third place of jitro.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra place with the meaning of the third place of jitro and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is associated with some form of control over an event described or indicated by the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: jitro, ji'o, se ji'o.
** Keywords:  Controlling event.

